          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "చొరబడు — corabaḍu — \"to break in; to intrude\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "దొంగలు కిటికీ నుంచి ఇంట్లోకి చొరబడ్డారు. doṅgalu kiṭikī nuñci iṇṭlōki corabaḍḍāru. The thieves broke into the house through the window."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): చొరబడ్డాను, corabaḍḍānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The place you enter takes -లోకి, into: ఇంట్లోకి చొరబడు (corabaḍu)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "చొరబడు (corabaḍu) is a native compound: the stem cor- of coccu, \"to enter, penetrate\" (DEDR 2778), with paḍu, the helping verb of things that befall."
            }
          ]
        },
